WEBVTT

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:08.860
The 34 city-states of the Cuore di Rumeriana

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:11.530
are forming the Cuore Alliance

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:14.780
to establish a third power in Rumeriana.

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:29.050
Altair: A Record of Battles

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:51.460
We will not allow the Empire and your Tripartite Alliance
to selfishly bring war and strife to our lands.

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:53.050
Wishing on Stars

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:58.050
Our Cuore Alliance will serve to pressure both powers

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:00.510
with the ultimate goal of avoiding conflict.

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:06.600
In order to maintain our neutrality, we cannot allow
Torqye passage through our territory.

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:12.320
These are the signatures of the Fiorian people who are
against granting Torqye passage through our territory.

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:19.030
The mere rumor of my meeting with the Torqyean envoy
gathered this many signatures.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:21.570
Is this the reason she met with us?

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:26.790
If she needed these signatures of opposition, does that
mean there are those who are against the Empire?

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:34.550
Thanks to them, my fellow national leaders and I were
able to come to a swift conclusion for our assembly.

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:40.130
Naturally, our firm position will be equally
applied to the Empire, and not just limited Torqye--

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:43.850
Sorry, but you're going to have to start over.

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:48.180
-Curse you, barbarian!
-Guards, throw him out!

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:53.480
This is a message a Torqyean kulak
sacrificed his life to deliver.

00:02:55.980 --> 00:03:00.740
Three days ago, Balt-Rhein took over Scoglio.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:06.240
The Empire is using their conquests
over Scoglio and Phoinike

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:11.580
to claim they have the right to the territories
of the old Phoinikian Empire.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:18.380
Pardon my forwardness, but in the same way Phoinike
was blinded by their pride and 3000 years of history,

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:24.390
Cuore determined their position because of their
relationships with your neighboring countries.

00:03:24.720 --> 00:03:28.270
It is vital we all assess and adapt
to the current state of affairs,

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:32.980
so our decisions are not mired by the past,
or we will be consumed by the Empire.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.400
Do you have proof this information is true?

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:41.360
Like we could ever trust the word of a barbarian!

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:44.200
The Gonfaloniere should already be aware

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:49.000
that Suleyman Bey is not a man who would lie.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:59.840
We will postpone the assembly.

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:04.840
Fiore will carefully examine all
possible options available to the Cuore

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:08.680
in order to weather the coming storm.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:11.310
Throw these men in the prison.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:24.700
We cannot allow Torqye passage through our lands!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:27.660
But if Scoglio has really fallen...

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:31.620
We should still search for a path to remain neutral.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:37.380
A horseman has just arrived.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:41.460
On February 14th, after three days of fighting,

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:44.970
the Dux regionis Scoglio surrendered
to the Balt-Rhein Empire.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:49.680
Everything you said has turned out to be true.

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:54.060
The Cuore Alliance will grant your army passage
through our territory.

00:04:54.890 --> 00:05:01.070
At present, your Tripartite Military Alliance is the only
force capable of resisting the Empire.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:06.610
As long as the dispatch of Torqye's army to the Centro
is the only pressure that can be placed on the Empire,

00:05:06.780 --> 00:05:09.780
we have no reason to interfere.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:16.250
On the matter of the Empire, the Cuore will side
with your Tripartite Alliance.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:20.250
We are very grateful to you, Gonfaloniere.

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:22.920
Now that we have formed the Cuore Alliance,

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:28.970
we will find our own means of hindering the Empire.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:35.690
It is important to place deterrences in the unlikely event
that the Tripartite Alliance becomes out of control.

00:05:35.940 --> 00:05:37.810
I do not mean to be forward,

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:43.190
but I believe it prudent that security
for the Cuore's heads of state be increased.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.320
I have doubled the number of bodyguards.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:50.580
I don't have time to fall to an anti-Torqyean
assassin's dagger, after all.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:54.750
Then I shall send a pigeon to Halil Pasha right away.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:58.000
I am sure he has been waiting anxiously
by the Torqyean border.

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:00.920
Next, we'll have to go to South Rumeriana.

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.300
Go to Tauro for me first.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:08.180
We'll need to secure that location in order
for Torqye to enter South Rumeriana.

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.090
Are you not coming with us, Bey?

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:14.220
I still have something I need to do.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:17.890
This is treason!

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:20.150
Those dastardly Torqyeans!

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:25.740
If the Dux regionis Scoglio has really fallen,
then all the more reason to side with the Empire.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:30.950
It would be better to yield and survive
than resist and face destruction.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:34.450
We will make a direct appeal.
Everything will be decided tomorrow.

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:37.910
We need to make the Gonfaloniere
overturn her decision.

00:06:38.120 --> 00:06:39.750
But how?

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:43.920
She is surrounded by elite guards all day.

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:46.920
There is a way.

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:51.010
If we follow the Rossi family's hidden passageway
that I've discovered,

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:55.510
we will be able to reach her quarters
without being seen.

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:06.900
Giacomo? What is the meaning of this?

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:12.030
We would like you to reconsider your decision
on allowing Torqye passage through our territory.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.240
There is nothing to reconsider.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:16.700
Do you mean to destroy Fiore?

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:22.830
Perhaps the truth is that you've sold our country
to Torqye, having been seduced by an old lover!

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.750
This is no laughing matter!

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:26.750
Gonfaloniere.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:32.550
As a militarily inferior country, we should not choose
to oppose the Empire.

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:36.930
In order for Fiore to remain the center
for the arts and culture,

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:40.230
it is absolutely necessary
that we are not involved in war.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.520
However, the flames of war are spreading.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:48.650
You are right to worry that despite the Cuore Alliance's
wealth and economic strength,

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:51.820
it will be too difficult to remain neutral.

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:55.410
We will eventually be swallowed up
by one of these powers.

00:07:55.740 --> 00:08:00.450
Without a choice, we will lose everything.

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:03.790
So you are willing to join forces
with the Torqyean barbarians?

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:05.580
How could we face our ancestors?

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:09.800
I am the Gonfaloniere of the Republic of Fiore.

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:14.430
I am doing this for the citizens who have elected me,
for our nation.

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:19.180
As the young pasha from Torqye had stated,
it is my job to choose the best path

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:25.190
that will ensure Fiore's continued prosperity,
without being mired by the past.

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:29.320
I will not be so foolish
as to involve my personal feelings.

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:34.240
-What are you doing?
-We have no other choice.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:38.530
Did you think we would just leave quietly
if we failed to change her mind?

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:42.370
She will have to die
for the greater good of our country.

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:44.120
Stop this!

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:48.960
Giacomo, Fiore cannot be saved
as long as this woman is the Gonfaloniere.

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:52.010
This is the only way. Do it.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:00.220
See, I told you that staying behind would pay off.

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:15.200
Mahmut Pasha and I have already had our homelands
destroyed by the Empire.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:18.370
There are many ways to avoid war,

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:23.200
but the Empire isn't something
that's interested in cooperation.

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:29.000
We promise to protect Fiore our own way.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:32.050
Why don't you all just calm down
and think this over again?

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:41.970
I shall guard your quarters to ensure
no further harm comes to you,

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:43.970
Gonfaloniere.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:52.570
The mercenary band El Toro from Tauro
are famous for being vicious.

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:56.780
They're the people we passed by in Arno.
They did seem pretty nasty.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:10:02.580
Even so, we have to get them to grant Torqye passage
through their territory.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:07.750
Hey, you're that Torqyean!

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:10.500
Speak of the devil.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:13.710
Are you heading to Tauro next then?

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:17.970
We were on our way back to Tauro
to prepare for our next job.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.220
You guys want to hire a guide?

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:24.640
Like we could trust the people
who basically got fired by Arno.

00:10:24.810 --> 00:10:27.140
Let's just ignore them, Mahmut Pasha.

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.350
Pasha? You're a pasha?

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:31.230
What if I am?

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:37.900
I'm El Toro's Erbach. If you're going to meet
with Tauro's mayor, I'll talk to them for you.

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:41.200
But those twins are quite the handful.

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:43.030
Twins?

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:47.120
SOUTH RUMERIANA
NEAR THE SCOGLIO-CAMPANA BORDER

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:49.670
KULAK OF CAMPANA
BLANCA

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:51.880
They're here.

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:00.260
TORQYE PASHALU
BATI

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:04.890
It seems this good news
was one day behind the bad news.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:07.810
The Empire always seems to be one step ahead.

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:12.400
Halil Pasha, all forces are ready to be deployed.

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:15.110
Then let us go.

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:21.490
Listen up, men. We are our nation's
first expeditionary force.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:25.740
Every action we make
will determine Torqye's reputation.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.410
We cannot face the Empire

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:33.130
if we lose the trust of the people of the Cuore,
and ruin Torqye's pact with the Cuore.

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:35.710
I want you all to take that to heart!

00:11:35.840 --> 00:11:37.090
Efendim!

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:42.800
Good answer. Army of the Seventh Eyalet, march!

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:46.810
TAURO CITY

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:51.140
I've heard the rumors of the young genius pasha
from Torqye.

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:54.020
I'm Tauro's mayor, Izquierda.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:56.610
And I am Derecho, also mayor.

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:05.120
We despise talentless commanding officers
whose ranks are merely titles.

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:10.330
If you want to pass through Tauro,
why don't you start by proving that you're different.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:16.090
If not, we're not interested in helping you
or the Torqye Pashalu.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:18.340
How would you like me to prove myself?

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:24.840
I will lend you 400 of our mercenaries.

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:28.260
Use them to take the castle gate we'll be defending.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:34.400
If you're able to grab the feather from my brother
Derecho's hat on the top floor, you win.

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:38.770
Understood. Please look forward to it.

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:42.400
We will show you Torqyean tactics.

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:47.570
All right, listen up, you animals!

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:50.410
We're playing by our typical training rules.

00:12:50.580 --> 00:12:56.080
No blades, and if you get hit with red dye,
you are out.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:01.590
Once the attackers are within 300 zira from the walls,
the battle begins.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:05.470
You have until the fourth strike of the noon bell.

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:08.050
REPUBLIC OF VENEDIK

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:12.600
Deliver those to all the cities in the Eastern Centro.

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:17.940
They're the official documents announcing the Tripartite
Alliance and our call to other nations to join us.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:22.650
Also, order Brega's Fleet back
from Lucchino Island immediately.

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:24.280
STATE SHIPYARD

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:28.070
Additionally, we will be operating our state shipyards
24 hours a day starting now.

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:33.580
Only military vessels will be built and repaired, and all
trade vessels will be entrusted to private shipyards.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:37.540
We will make the Centro ours again!

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:44.130
TORQYE PASHALU
ALTU

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:47.340
To think the Empire would march their expeditionary
forces during the winter

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:50.800
when they are most disadvantaged,

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:54.060
it seems there is no turning back for them.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.740
We'll draw their attention to the front gate
while we take down the back.

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:12.450
We will do the unexpected.

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:13.620
BALTA SULTANLU
OWA

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:15.410
Do you understand, Kemal?

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:19.210
The Empire has become much more cunning.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:22.710
We must become equally as cunning,
or we will not be able to fight.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:26.840
Remember this well, Kemal.

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:29.970
MUZRAK SULTANLU
SHARK

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:33.970
It is not necessary for you to watch me so closely.

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:38.640
I vow to give my life to defend the Muzrak Sultanlu.

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:41.810
If I don't,

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:45.190
I will never be able to make it up to you, brother.

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:49.410
Why do we need to stop exporting
weapons to Balt-Rhein?

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:50.570
BUCHAK SULTANLU
MUJHER

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:54.080
With prices high, there is no better opportunity.

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:57.000
I'll take from them as much as I can.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:15:00.670
That should be more devastating to them
in the long run.

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.500
KULUCH SULTANLU
ACAYIP SUBURBS

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:05.050
There is no need to worry, Mother.

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:07.380
We have that man on our side.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:10.800
Yes, Mahmut Pasha.

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:12.930
Now! Fire!

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:19.600
ARYIROS

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:21.650
So Balt-Rhein has crossed the border.

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:25.520
To think the starvation tactic
the boy employed had no effect,

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:31.410
it means there was no stopping Balt-Rhein at all.

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:36.290
Boy, if you do not wish for the world to end,

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:39.960
show me how you are going to fight back.

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:42.290
-The Empire did?
-The Empire did?

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:48.420
Yes, Master Wang said Rumeriana will become
even more unstable.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.970
Please be careful on your journey.

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:57.600
Does it really mean that empires
are destined for war and strife?

00:15:58.810 --> 00:16:01.600
Well, there's no sense in us worrying about that.

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:04.980
Besides, Mahmut's on his way there, right?

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:08.610
Then trust me, by the time we get back from the East,

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:12.570
he'll have everything taken care of.

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:15.490
You're right.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.410
I trust this was to your satisfaction.

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:21.830
Yes, you win.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:27.000
Tauro City shall grant the Torqyean forces
through our territory.

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:42.230
CAMPANA

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:49.440
Boss! Boss!

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:52.650
Vasco, you've done enough. It's no use.

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:57.910
I'm sorry I couldn't do better by you.

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:03.660
Take this, and escape the country.

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:07.750
Make the Empire pay for this.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.670
Boss! Boss!

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:19.140
Boss. Everyone.

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:28.150
Move!

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:35.400
I promise to avenge all of you!

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:51.710
There's someone inside?

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:54.460
You'll pay for this, kid!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:01.970
Curse you!

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.770
Come with me!

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:15.070
My name is Blanca, kulak for Torqye.

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:17.820
I am sorry that you were the only one I could save.

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:24.290
Torqye is the Empire's enemy, right?

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:29.000
-Yes.
-Then please take me to Torqye too.

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:37.590
I can't believe you won.

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:41.510
Don't worry, we'll keep our promise.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.510
You both have our thanks.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:47.310
But don't get the wrong idea.

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:51.610
This doesn't mean we've sided with Torqye.
We're free soldiers.

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:53.480
That's how it is.

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:59.990
Once we've earned our pay, we don't care
if our client dies, or a country crumbles.

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:03.990
I see. In that case, I should do what Torqye does best,

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:09.000
and hire all of Tauros' mercenaries with this money.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:15.170
In other words, you're going to buy
our allegiance with money?

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:18.880
Seems like the pashas
from a trade nation think differently.

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:23.640
But Mahmut, Tauro City has 7500 mercenaries.

00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:26.390
This isn't nearly enough.

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:28.810
This is only a deposit.

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:32.310
I'll have them bring the rest from Torqye.

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:34.560
We will pay however much it costs to hire

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:38.820
all of El Toro's soldiers until we're able
to defeat the Empire.

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:41.950
What should we do, Izquierda?

00:19:42.110 --> 00:19:45.410
Do you even need to ask? Of course we're accepting!

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:49.620
-You've got yourself a deal!
-You've got yourself a deal!

00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:56.550
Oh, boy. To be honest, I didn't think you had
what it took to be on the battlefield.

00:19:57.090 --> 00:20:02.050
You hate war, right? I figured,
such a person couldn't win a fight.

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:04.550
But you won.

00:20:06.140 --> 00:20:08.220
I can't figure you out.

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:16.020
Your mission may be to stop the war,
but you leave a pile of corpses wherever you go.

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:17.980
That's what it feels like.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:21.860
I would appreciate it if you refrained
from this distasteful teasing.

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:27.450
Oh, I'll come with you.
Ignoring a mysterious guy like you

00:20:28.370 --> 00:20:29.950
just wouldn't sit right.

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.370
Do as you please.

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:35.500
BALT-RHEIN EMPIRE
MICHAEL

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:41.050
What is that, Minister Louis?
It's very similar to a chess piece.

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:44.550
It's the last ray of hope for the Torqye Pashalu.

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:50.810
If Torqye befalls danger, this piece will always appear.

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:53.810
But all of that

00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:56.810
ends here.

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:58.520
ESPADA

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:01.320
Espada shall give its full support
to the Torqyean army.

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:05.410
Please tell me if there's anything we can do.

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:08.870
You have our thanks, Estadista Alonzo.

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:13.460
We have started to see support
for our Tripartite Alliance.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:17.330
Humo, Seallant, Espada.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:18.840
This is a good pace.

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:23.840
At this rate, we'll be able to arrive at Chielo, the gateway
to the Western Centro, in two days.

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:26.380
I hope so.

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:29.470
I am Adan, the kulak stationed in Espada.

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:31.520
I have some bad news.

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:36.600
Three days ago, Campana was taken by the Empire.

00:21:37.270 --> 00:21:39.650
They say the elderly and children were killed,

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:45.320
while the rest were sold to Tharrosan slavers
at Scoglio's port.

00:21:45.740 --> 00:21:49.740
And those in Campana and its neighbors
who heard this news

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:52.790
have surrendered to the Empire one after the other.

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:55.830
What are you going to do?

00:21:56.000 --> 00:22:01.250
It seems all the negotiating, bargaining
and trust building you've done

00:22:01.500 --> 00:22:07.260
has been outdone by a simple swing of the fist.

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:09.220
There is still Chielo.

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:12.970
I will do all that I can.

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:15.060
That is the only way.

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:54.320
Welcome to Chielo. This is where those
who cannot fight can live peacefully and die.

00:23:54.490 --> 00:23:56.580
We can't afford to lose it.

00:23:56.910 --> 00:23:59.040
Next time, "The Cage of Paradise."

00:23:59.200 --> 00:24:01.540
We'll be needing your assistance.
